- 2016ApJ...816...37V: Inclination and peak rotation velocity cannot be independently determined at current resolution
- 2016ApJ...816...37V: FIR/TIR luminosities strongly model dependent; more photometry needed
- 2016ApJ...823...68S: Missing short spacings; fluxes are lower limits; outflow mass highly uncertain
- 2020ApJ...901..151S: Electron density of ionized gas is uncertain, and xi is difficult to estimate
- 2024ApJ...969..122Y: Sample size too small for statistical conclusions; FRB-site limit not constraining.
- 2020ApJ...889..141T: [CII]-1 could be an artifact of disk asymmetry; deeper observations needed
- 2013AJ....146...47I: Missing flux for emission >6''; HCN 4-3 sub-thermal conclusion depends on it
- 2018Sci...362.1034D: U1 may be at a different redshift; stellar mass and SFR uncertain by factor of 2
