- 2019A&A...631A..91G: A521 lacks resolution along the major axis, so differences may be hidden
- 2019ApJ...870...39V: 3DBAROLO gives no error estimates; rotation curve turnover radius may be affected by beam smearing
- 2020A&A...633A.127F: Mass uncertainty dominated by assumed alpha and geometry; values are lower limits due to projection
- 2024ApJ...976...88L: Literature comparison sample is heterogeneous and of differing data quality
- 2019ApJ...876..112R: Only two galaxies; extended [CII] likely resolved out
- 2019A&A...623A..79C: Non-circular motions in barred galaxies not modelled; torus decoupling and missing flux add uncertainty
- 2020ApJ...890...29F: Flux filtered by the interferometer on large scales is hard to quantify
- 2020ApJ...890...29F: N(H2) is a lower limit due to beam dilution and depends on alpha_CO
- 2024MNRAS.534..683Z: Cluster age/mass estimate is rough; small sample for separations
- 2024MNRAS.534..683Z: CO may be optically thick, underestimating column density

